      },
      "text": "By the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and laws of the  \nUnited States of America, including the Federal Advisory Committee Act, as  \namended (5 U.S.C. App. I), and in order to increase the membership and  \nextend the life of the President’s Private Sector Survey on Cost Control in the  \nFederal Government, it is hereby ordered that Executive Order No. 12369 of  \nJune 30,1982, is amended as follows:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1340,
      "char_start": 1156,
