        "page_or_item": "48 FR 377, PDF pages 7-7",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "4330a1aa743f228ed915aa5a8b604a42291e75b8dfd394d74d60d66c22e39408",
        "signing_date": "1982-12-31",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12398.txt",
        "text_sha256": "87f8611e1e077866955f3b1daa7e303a79a25e1789e30e1497e77ba52caec325",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1983-01-05/pdf/FR-1983-01-05.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(a) The second sentence of Section 1(a) shall read: “The Committee shall be  \ncomposed of not more than 170 members appointed by the President from  \namong citizens in private life.’’."
    },
